ts": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Write a dialogue about things you would like to do next year. Complete the\nfollowing steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}], "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa in San Francisco"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sweet Treats in the City"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scuba diving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an activity you do to explore underwater life"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love scuba diving. There is so much to explore underwater!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beachwear"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "items you wear on the beach"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't find my suitcase! I have all my beachwear inside!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Good to see you!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I'm very happy to see you!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Good to see you! I'm happy you're here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mile"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a measure for distance in the Imperial system; 1.6 km"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Golden Gate Bridge is 7 miles away."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "yard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a measure for distance in the Imperial system; 90 cm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bus stop is 50 yards away."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cable car"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a vehicle attached to a cable that goes up a hill"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Cable cars are good to get up the hills in San Francisco."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pier"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a structure that leads out into a body of water"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can take the ferry from Pier 39. It's 50 yards away."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to consider something; to examine something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm looking into applying to university next year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "culinary school "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an institution where you learn how to cook professionally"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm thinking of applying to culinary school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le02ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing New Places"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you describe a city, you can talk about its geographical features using words like <span class=\"italic\">hill, bay, river, park.</span><br> Cities also have neighborhoods, like Haight-Ashbury in San Francisco. Neighborhoods are locations.<br><br>You use wh- questions to ask for directions in a neighborhood or a building. <br>You can use the Imperative, expressions and prepositions of place to give directions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hill\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"down<br>up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">down the hill</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bay\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">by the bay</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"river\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by<br>near\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">near the river</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"park\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in<br>at<br>near\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">in the park</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"neighborhood\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">in Haight-Ashbury</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Saying How Far Places Are"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to know how far a place is, you can use the question: <span class=\"italic\">How far is \u2026 ?</span><br> You can reply with a specific distance if you know the answer, like <span class=\"italic\">It's 50 yards away</span>.<br> In North America, you use the Imperial system, not the metric system.<br><br>If a place is nearby, you use yards to say how far it is.<br> If a place is far, you use miles to say how far it is."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: How far is the culinary school?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: It's 2 miles away. It's down by the bay, near the pier."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imperial System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Metric System\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 mile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1.6 kilometers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 yard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"91 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1 foot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"30 centimeters\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I inch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2.5 centimeters\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Talk to your partner about 5 things you would each like to do next year."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner for suggestions on doing these things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make suggestions to your partner about their list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a dialogue on your plans and intentions. Practice it with your partner aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about intentions and plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions and requests about things to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write and practice a dialogue about plans for the future."}]}], "type": "sena"}